\"language-math math-inline\">q^2 - q + 1 - q^{-1} + q^{-2}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cinquefoil</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,5}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5_1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-q^{-10} + q^{-9} - q^{-8} + q^{-7} + q^{-5}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Septafoil</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,7}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7_1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-q^{-18} + q^{-17} - q^{-16} + q^{-15} - q^{-14} + q^{-13} + q^{-11}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,4}</code> knot</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,4}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">8_{19}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">8</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q^{-7} - q^{-6} + q^{-5} - 2q^{-4} + q^{-3} + q^{-1}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,5}</code> knot</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,5}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">10_{124}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">10</code></td>\n<td>(10-term polynomial; see body text)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-transfer-matrices/tm-notation-table2-data.md","heading":"Table"}
